<title>AUSTRALIA: Woolworths appoints Dahlsen as chairman.</title>
<headline>Woolworths appoints Dahlsen as chairman.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian retailer Woolworths Ltd said on Friday it had appointed John Dahlsen as chairman, succeeding John Iliffe who died on May 24.</p>
<p>Woolworths said Dahlsen had been a director since August 1992 and was also a director of Australia and New Zealand Banking Group Ltd.</p>
<p>--Sydney newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
